{
  "_about": "The 27 Poké Balls. weight is the chance in percent that a catch comes in that ball (the catchable ones add up to 100). Tiers follow how hard each ball is to get in the games: basic = sold in every Poké Mart; special = sold only in some marts or given as a bonus (PokeAPI special-balls); apricorn = hand-made from Apricorns (apricorn-balls); limited = only at one place (Safari Zone, Bug-Catching Contest, Ultra Space); master = one per game. event balls (Park, Dream, Cherish) never come from a wild catch: like in the games, they are only given (catch: false). A legendary or mythical catch comes in a Master Ball 1% of the time (MASTER_FOR_LEGENDS in server/pokedex.js). art = the picture on Bulbagarden Archives; tools/import-balls.mjs bundles it.",
